-- float: ObjScale (39) 0.98: the setup's two spheres (r 0.55 m at z 0.54 and 1.52, measured from client_portal.dat) become
-- r 0.54 m at 0.53 and 1.49. The retail Coral Golem draws 2.68 m over its 2.07 m of spheres; the
-- round-5 golem draws 2.63 m, so 0.98 keeps the golem's own ratio. It also sets the speed: ACE's MoveSpeed is the table's
-- run speed 2.565 m/s x RunRate x ObjScale = 2.51 m/s with Run 0 (RunRate 1.0); the glb's RunForward (a heavy
-- stride) is authored at that, WalkForward at the table's 1.48 m/s x ObjScale.
-- Resistances (64-70: slash, pierce, bludgeon, fire, cold, acid, electric): strong against slash and pierce, weak to bludgeon
-- and lightning (concept appendix D). The golem's own are 0.33 / 0.67 / 1.0 / 0.5 x4.
